msgstr "YAML (chaguomsingi)"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Usanidi wa SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Ruhusa zako za kifaa hazijumuishi kila kifaa, kwa hivyo huwezi kuhamisha au kuingiza usanidi wa SmokePing. Mwombe msimamizi aliye na ufikiaji wa vifaa vyote."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Hamisha Usanidi wa SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Uhamishaji unashikilia mipangilio ya programu-jalizi, shabaha za SmokePing ambazo programu-jalizi imesoma, na kifaa ambacho kila moja imeoanishwa nacho, kwa jina la mpangishaji na maelezo ya kifaa. Hauna chanzo cha data, grafu, faili ya RRD, wala kitambulisho."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Pakua"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Ingiza Usanidi wa SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Kuchagua faili kunaikagua tu. Skrini inayofuata inaorodhesha kila badiliko ambalo faili ingefanya, na hakuna kinachoandikwa hadi uthibitishe orodha hiyo. Uingizaji huongeza na kusasisha; haufuti shabaha wala kuhamisha uoanishaji kamwe, na hauundi faili ya RRD wala kugusa saraka ya data ya SmokePing."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Kagua Faili"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Ukaguzi wa Uingizaji"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "Hakuna kilichoandikwa."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Nyuma"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "Faili haiwezi kuingizwa hadi hitilafu hizi zirekebishwe. Hakuna kilichoandikwa."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Usakinishaji tayari unalingana na faili. Hakuna cha kuingiza."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Mpango %s. Kutekeleza kunafanya mabadiliko haya hasa katika muamala mmoja. Ikiwa faili au usakinishaji ulibadilika tangu ukaguzi huu, uingizaji unakataliwa na unakagua tena."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Tekeleza Uingizaji"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Ghairi"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Ongeza Shabaha za SmokePing"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "hakuna shabaha ya SmokePing inayolingana"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Bofya Endelea ili kuongeza shabaha za SmokePing ambazo mpangishaji wake ni jina la mpangishaji la kila kifaa kilichochaguliwa. Kila shabaha hupata grafu ya muhtasari kwa ajili ya arifa na, data ya SmokePing inapoweza kuchorwa kwenye grafu, grafu ya smoke. Vifaa haviundwi hapa kamwe."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "Shabaha %d zinalingana."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "Vipengee %d vimeundwa au kuoanishwa, %d vimerukwa."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Kifaa hiki kina shabaha za SmokePing, lakini kisomaji kinachojaza thamani zake za muhtasari kinaendeshwa kwenye kikusanyaji %d na kifaa kimehifadhiwa kwenye kikusanyaji %d. Thamani za muhtasari na arifa zitasimama hadi kifaa kigawiwe kikusanyaji %d tena."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "Shabaha za SmokePing za Kifaa Hiki"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "Grafu %d za smoke bado zinachora rangi nyingine; kikusanyaji kikuu huhamisha hadi 200 kwa kila mzunguko."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "Grafu %d za smoke hazikuweza kuhamishwa; endesha upgrade-graphs ili kuzijaribu tena, na uangalie kumbukumbu ya Cacti kuona sababu."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Mpangilio wa Rangi za Upotevu unaomba rangi za upotevu za SmokePing %s, lakini kisomaji kilipata SmokePing %s. Uwekee Kiotomatiki isipokuwa kama grafu zinapaswa kutofautiana na za SmokePing."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Mpangilio wa Rangi za Upotevu huchagua rangi za upotevu za SmokePing %s kwa grafu za smoke."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Kisomaji hakikupata toleo la SmokePing, kwa hivyo mpangilio wa Rangi za Upotevu huchagua rangi za upotevu za SmokePing 2.8 na baadaye. Ikiwa SmokePing ni 2.7, weka Rangi za Upotevu kuwa SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Kisomaji kilipata SmokePing %s, kwa hivyo mpangilio wa Rangi za Upotevu huchagua rangi zake za upotevu."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "Thold haijasakinishwa, kwa hivyo hakuna shabaha inayotoa arifa katika SmokePing na Thold zote mbili."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Hakuna shabaha iliyo na arifa ya SmokePing na kizingiti cha Thold kilichowashwa."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "Shabaha %d zina arifa ya SmokePing na kizingiti cha Thold kilichowashwa, kwa hivyo tatizo moja linaweza kutoa arifa mara mbili. Linganisha masharti yao ya arifa kabla ya kuondoa mojawapo: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Violezo vya SmokePing vilishindwa kuingizwa na havijaribiwi tena kiotomatiki: %s Tumia Jaribu Tena Uingizaji wa Kiolezo baada ya kurekebisha sababu."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "Violezo vya SmokePing havijaingizwa. Tumia Jaribu Tena Uingizaji wa Kiolezo."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php smokeping_health.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are imported."
msgstr "Violezo vya SmokePing vimeingizwa."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Every device with summary data sources is polled by the reader's poller."
msgstr "Kila kifaa kilicho na vyanzo vya data ya muhtasari kinakusanywa na kikusanyaji cha kisomaji."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d devices have summary data sources but are not polled by poller %d, which runs the reader, so their summary values and alerts have no data: %s"
msgstr "Vifaa %d vina vyanzo vya data ya muhtasari lakini havikusanywi na kikusanyaji %d, kinachoendesha kisomaji, kwa hivyo thamani zake za muhtasari na arifa hazina data: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration is read on poller %d, not on this server; the inventory row shows the result of its last read."
msgstr "Usanidi wa SmokePing unasomwa kwenye kikusanyaji %d, si kwenye seva hii; safu ya orodha inaonyesha matokeo ya usomaji wake wa mwisho."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "Usanidi wa SmokePing %s hauwezi kusomwa: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets; %d entries are skipped: %s"
msgstr "Usanidi wa SmokePing %s unaorodhesha shabaha %d; maingizo %d yamerukwa: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets."
msgstr "Usanidi wa SmokePing %s unaorodhesha shabaha %d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The PHP binary path setting is empty or not an executable file, so the reader cannot start."
msgstr "Mpangilio wa njia ya faili tumizi ya PHP uko tupu au si faili inayoweza kuendeshwa, kwa hivyo kisomaji hakiwezi kuanza."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader starts with %s."
msgstr "Kisomaji huanza na %s."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader has not completed a run on this poller."
msgstr "Kisomaji hakijakamilisha uendeshaji kwenye kikusanyaji hiki."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last reader run finished %d seconds ago, more than three poller intervals."
msgstr "Uendeshaji wa mwisho wa kisomaji ulikamilika sekunde %d zilizopita, zaidi ya vipindi vitatu vya kikusanyaji."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds and has exceeded its time budget %d times."
msgstr "Kisomaji kilisoma mfululizo %d kati ya %d kwa sekunde %.1f na kimezidi muda wake uliopangwa mara %d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds, %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Kisomaji kilisoma mfululizo %d kati ya %d kwa sekunde %.1f, sekunde %d zilizopita."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No inventory has been read on this poller."
msgstr "Hakuna orodha iliyosomwa kwenye kikusanyaji hiki."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last inventory failed %d seconds ago and the previous one is still in use: %s"
msgstr "Orodha ya mwisho ilishindwa sekunde %d zilizopita na ile iliyotangulia bado inatumika: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The inventory listed %d targets %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Orodha iliorodhesha shabaha %d sekunde %d zilizopita."

