msgstr "Ingiza Usanidi wa SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Usanidi"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "Faili ya SmokePing iliyosanidiwa inasomwa pamoja na faili inazojumuisha, kutoka kwa saraka yake yenyewe. Faili iliyopakiwa inasomwa peke yake: @include hairuhusiwi ndani yake."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "The configured file, %s"
msgstr "Faili iliyosanidiwa, %s"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "An uploaded file, without @include"
msgstr "Faili iliyopakiwa, bila @include"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Uploaded File"
msgstr "Faili Iliyopakiwa"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for an uploaded file: a SmokePing configuration of at most 4 MiB."
msgstr "Kwa faili iliyopakiwa pekee: usanidi wa SmokePing usiozidi 4 MiB."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Vifaa"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host groups targets that probe the same host. A device that already has the host name on the chosen poller is used instead of a new one."
msgstr "Kifaa kimoja kwa kila mpangishaji wa SmokePing kinakusanya shabaha zinazochunguza mpangishaji yuleyule. Kifaa ambacho tayari kina jina la mpangishaji kwenye kikusanyaji kilichochaguliwa hutumika badala ya kipya."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host"
msgstr "Kifaa kimoja kwa kila mpangishaji wa SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing target"
msgstr "Kifaa kimoja kwa kila shabaha ya SmokePing"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Device Template"
msgstr "Kiolezo cha Kifaa"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The template of devices the import creates."
msgstr "Kiolezo cha vifaa ambavyo uingizaji huunda."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Kikusanyaji"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The poller of new devices. It must be the poller that runs the SmokePing reader, or their summary data sources get no data."
msgstr "Kikusanyaji cha vifaa vipya. Lazima kiwe kikusanyaji kinachoendesha kisomaji cha SmokePing, la sivyo vyanzo vyake vya data ya muhtasari havitapata data."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
