msgstr "Hakuna"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Graph Tree"
msgstr "Mti wa Grafu"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Mirror the SmokePing hierarchy into a graph tree: each section becomes a branch, and each device a host under the branch of its targets. Existing branches and hosts are reused."
msgstr "Akisi mpangilio wa SmokePing katika mti wa grafu: kila sehemu inakuwa tawi, na kila kifaa kinakuwa mpangishaji chini ya tawi la shabaha zake. Matawi na wapangishaji waliopo hutumika tena."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "A new tree, named below"
msgstr "Mti mpya, uliotajwa hapa chini"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Do not mirror"
msgstr "Usiakisi"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "New Tree Name"
msgstr "Jina la Mti Mpya"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for a new tree. A tree that already has this name is used."
msgstr "Kwa mti mpya pekee. Mti ambao tayari una jina hili hutumika."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Preview reads the configuration and lists what the import would create. Nothing is written until you confirm that list on the next screen, and SmokePing's own files are never written."
msgstr "Onyesho la awali linasoma usanidi na kuorodhesha kile ambacho uingizaji ungeunda. Hakuna kinachoandikwa hadi uthibitishe orodha hiyo kwenye skrini inayofuata, na faili za SmokePing zenyewe haziandikwi kamwe."

