#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Poller"
msgstr "Poller ya SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Poller ya Cacti inayofanya kazi kwenye, au inayoshiriki mfumo wa faili na, seva pangishi ya SmokePing. Ni poller hii pekee inayoweza kusoma data ya SmokePing."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration File"
msgstr "Faili ya Usanidi ya SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The main SmokePing configuration file, read by the poller that runs the reader. The plugin reads it and the files it includes with its own parser and never writes to them. Includes must stay inside this file's directory."
msgstr "Faili kuu ya usanidi ya SmokePing, inayosomwa na poller inayoendesha kisomaji. Programu-jalizi huisoma pamoja na faili zinazojumuishwa kwa kutumia kichanganuzi chake chenyewe na haiandiki humo kamwe. Faili zinazojumuishwa lazima zibaki ndani ya saraka ya faili hii."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Data Directory"
msgstr "Saraka ya Data ya SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The datadir from SmokePing's configuration, as SmokePing sees it."
msgstr "Saraka ya datadir kutoka kwa usanidi wa SmokePing, jinsi SmokePing inavyoiona."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Cacti Mount of the Data Directory"
msgstr "Mount ya Cacti ya Saraka ya Data"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "A read-only bind or NFS mount of the SmokePing data directory inside the Cacti RRA path. Cacti only reads RRD files inside its RRA path and never through a symlink."
msgstr "Mount ya bind ya kusoma tu au ya NFS ya saraka ya data ya SmokePing ndani ya njia ya RRA ya Cacti. Cacti husoma faili za RRD zilizo ndani ya njia yake ya RRA pekee na kamwe si kupitia symlink."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Kisomaji"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Bajeti ya Muda wa Kisomaji"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend reading RRD files before it stops and resumes on the next poller cycle."
msgstr "Sekunde ambazo uendeshaji mmoja wa kisomaji unaweza kutumia kusoma faili za RRD kabla ya kusimama na kuendelea katika mzunguko unaofuata wa poller."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Inventory Interval"
msgstr "Muda kati ya Ukaguzi wa Orodha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Minimum seconds between inventory runs. The inventory also runs when the configuration file changes."
msgstr "Kiwango cha chini cha sekunde kati ya uendeshaji wa ukaguzi wa orodha. Ukaguzi wa orodha pia huendeshwa faili ya usanidi inapobadilika."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness Allowance"
msgstr "Ruhusa ya Upya wa Data"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds past one step for which a measurement still counts as current."
msgstr "Sekunde baada ya hatua moja ambapo kipimo bado kinahesabiwa kuwa cha sasa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Loss Colors"
msgstr "Rangi za Upotevu"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Which SmokePing loss colors the smoke graphs draw. SmokePing 2.7 draws other loss levels than 2.8 and later. Automatic follows the SmokePing version the reader finds next to SmokePing, shown on the health page, and uses 2.8 and later when it finds none."
msgstr "Rangi zipi za upotevu za SmokePing ambazo grafu za smoke huchora. SmokePing 2.7 huchora viwango vingine vya upotevu kuliko 2.8 na matoleo ya baadaye. Otomatiki hufuata toleo la SmokePing ambalo kisomaji hupata karibu na SmokePing, likionyeshwa kwenye ukurasa wa afya, na hutumia 2.8 na matoleo ya baadaye lisipopata lolote."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Otomatiki"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.8 and later"
msgstr "SmokePing 2.8 na matoleo ya baadaye"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing 2.7"
msgstr "SmokePing 2.7"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Sakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Weka Majedwali ya Programu-jalizi Wakati wa Kusakinusha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its inventory, mapping, and health tables. SmokePing files are never removed either way."
msgstr "Ikichaguliwa, kuondoa programu-jalizi kutahifadhi majedwali yake ya orodha, ulinganishaji, na afya. Faili za SmokePing haziondolewi kamwe kwa vyovyote vile."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Backup Directory"
msgstr "Saraka ya Hifadhi Nakala"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Where the uninstall writes its export of the plugin configuration. Leave blank to use the cache/smokeping directory of Cacti, which the plugin protects with a deny-all rule. A directory set here must already exist, be writable, and be outside the web root; when it is not writable no export is written."
msgstr "Mahali ambapo uondoaji huandika uhamishaji wa usanidi wa programu-jalizi. Acha wazi ili kutumia saraka ya cache/smokeping ya Cacti, ambayo programu-jalizi huilinda kwa kanuni ya kuzuia yote. Saraka inayowekwa hapa lazima iwe tayari ipo, iweze kuandikwa, na iwe nje ya web root; isipoweza kuandikwa hakuna uhamishaji unaoandikwa."

